 "founded": "1937 (Gesellschaft zur Vorbereitung des Deutschen Volkswagens mbH); renamed Volkswagenwerk GmbH in 1938; first civilian cars from Wolfsburg in 1945",
 "founder": "German Labour Front (state-founded); Ferdinand Porsche designed the first car",
